{"type":"message","id":"953397be","parentId":"4e69466c","timestamp":"2026-03-11T14:12:35.784Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-03-11 23:12 GMT+9] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: The user wants to review personalization files one by one and assess whether content changes are needed. Prepare a concise, practical review framework in Korean for files like SOUL.md, USER.md, AGENTS.md, TOOLS.md, HEARTBEAT.md, IDENTITY.md. Include: recommended review order, what to check in each file, and a proposed workflow for iterative review/editing. Do not edit files. Keep it direct and operational."}],"timestamp":1773238355782}}
